# 腳本與設定一律以 LF checkout：Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 時，同一份 checkout 給 WSL／Linux 跑會出現 `bash\r: No such file`
* text=auto
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
